OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cold feeling day, with
OL,6,Fa gentle breeze. Dry, however, with
OL,7,Fsome cloud early in the morning in the
OL,8,Fnorth but plenty of sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIncreasingly cloudy with a
OL,12,Fstrengthening breeze through the
OL,13,Fevening. Feeling cold, with a few
OL,14,Fclear intervals before cloud thickens
OL,15,Ffrom the south overnight. Frosty.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA dry and frosty start. Cloud
OL,18,Fwill thicken through the morning,
OL,19,Fbringing outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,20,Feastward. Less cold than of late, with
OL,21,Fa gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
